{
  "data": {
    "id": "MAT.28.1-MAT.28.20",
    "orgId": "MAT.28.1-MAT.28.20",
    "bibleId": "7644de2e4c5188e5-01",
    "bookId": "MAT",
    "chapterIds": [
      "MAT.28"
    ],
    "reference": "ΚΑΤΑ ΜΑΤΘΑΙΟΝ 28:1-20",
    "content": [
      {
        "name": "para",
        "type": "tag",
        "attrs": {
          "style": "s"
        },
        "items": [
          {
            "text": "The Resurrection",
            "type": "text"
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "name": "para",
        "type": "tag",
        "attrs": {
          "style": "p"
        },
        "items": [
          {
            "text": "Ὀψὲ δὲ σαββάτων, τῇ ἐπιφωσκούσῃ εἰς μίαν σαββάτων, ἦλθε ",
            "type": "text",
            "attrs": {
              "verseId": "MAT.28.1",
              "verseOrgIds": [
                "MAT.28.1"
              ]
            }
          },
          {
            "text": "Μαρία ἡ Μαγδαληνή, καὶ ἡ ἄλλη Μαρία, θεωρῆσαι τὸν τάφον. ",
            "type": "text",
            "attrs": {
              "verseId": "MAT.28.1",
              "verseOrgIds": [
                "MAT.28.1"
              ]
            }
          },
          {
            "text": "Καὶ ἰδού, σεισμὸς ἐγένετο μέγας· ἄγγελος γὰρ Κυρίου καταβὰς ἐξ οὐρανοῦ, ",
            "type": "text",
            "attrs": {
              "verseId": "MAT.28.2",
              "verseOrgIds": [
                "MAT.28.2"
              ]
            }
          },
          {
            "text": "προσελθὼν ἀπεκύλισε τὸν λίθον ",
            "type": "text",
            "attrs": {
              "verseId": "MAT.28.2",
              "verseOrgIds": [
                "MAT.28.2"
              ]
            }
          },
          {
            "text": "ἀπὸ τῆς θύρας, καὶ ἐκάθητο ἐπάνω αὐτοῦ. ",
            "type": "text",
            "attrs": {
              "verseId": "MAT.28.2",
              "verseOrgIds": [
                "MAT.28.2"
              ]
            }
          },
          {
            "text": "Ἦν δὲ ἡ ",
            "type": "text",
            "attrs": {
              "verseId": "MAT.28.3",
              "verseOrgIds": [
                "MAT.28.3"
              ]
            }
          },
          {
            "text": "ἰδέα αὐτοῦ ὡς ἀστραπή, καὶ τὸ ἔνδυμα αὐτοῦ λευκὸν ",
            "type": "text",
            "attrs": {
              "verseId": "MAT.28.3",
              "verseOrgIds": [
                "MAT.28.3"
              ]
            }
          },
          {
            "text": "ὡσεὶ χιών. ",
            "type": "text",
            "attrs": {
              "verseId": "MAT.28.3",
              "verseOrgIds": [
                "MAT.28.3"
              ]
            }
          },
          {
            "text": "Ἀπὸ δὲ τοῦ φόβου αὐτοῦ ἐσείσθησαν οἱ τηροῦντες καὶ ",
            "type": "text",
            "attrs": {
              "verseId": "MAT.28.4",
              "verseOrgIds": [
                "MAT.28.4"
              ]
            }
          },
          {
            "text": "ἐγένοντο ὡσεὶ νεκροί. ",
            "type": "text",
            "attrs": {
              "verseId": "MAT.28.4",
              "verseOrgIds": [
                "MAT.28.4"
              ]
            }
          },
          {
            "text": "Ἀποκριθεὶς δὲ ὁ ἄγγελος εἶπε ταῖς γυναιξί, Μὴ φοβεῖσθε ὑμεῖς· οἶδα γὰρ ὅτι Ἰησοῦν τὸν ἐσταυρωμένον ζητεῖτε. ",
            "type": "text",
            "attrs": {
              "verseId": "MAT.28.5",
              "verseOrgIds": [
                "MAT.28.5"
              ]
            }
          },
          {
            "text": "Οὐκ ἔστιν ὧδε· ἠγέρθη γάρ, καθὼς εἶπε. Δεῦτε, ἴδετε τὸν τόπον ὅπου ἔκειτο ",
            "type": "text",
            "attrs": {
              "verseId": "MAT.28.6",
              "verseOrgIds": [
                "MAT.28.6"
              ]
            }
          },
          {
            "text": "ὁ Κύριος. ",
            "type": "text",
            "attrs": {
              "verseId": "MAT.28.6",
              "verseOrgIds": [
                "MAT.28.6"
              ]
            }
          },
          {
            "text": "Καὶ ταχὺ πορευθεῖσαι εἴπατε τοῖς μαθηταῖς αὐτοῦ ὅτι Ἠγέρθη ἀπὸ τῶν νεκρῶν· καὶ ἰδού, προάγει ὑμᾶς εἰς τὴν Γαλιλαίαν· ἐκεῖ αὐτὸν ὄψεσθε· ἰδού, εἶπον ὑμῖν. ",
            "type": "text",
            "attrs": {
              "verseId": "MAT.28.7",
              "verseOrgIds": [
                "MAT.28.7"
              ]
            }
          },
          {
            "text": "Καὶ ",
            "type": "text",
            "attrs": {
              "verseId": "MAT.28.8",
              "verseOrgIds": [
                "MAT.28.8"
              ]
            }
          },
          {
            "text": "ἐξελθοῦσαι ταχὺ ἀπὸ τοῦ μνημείου μετὰ φόβου καὶ χαρᾶς μεγάλης, ἔδραμον ἀπαγγεῖλαι τοῖς μαθηταῖς αὐτοῦ. ",
            "type": "text",
            "attrs": {
              "verseId": "MAT.28.8",
              "verseOrgIds": [
                "MAT.28.8"
              ]
            }
          },
          {
            "text": "Ὡς δὲ ἐπορεύοντο ἀπαγγεῖλαι τοῖς μαθηταῖς αὐτοῦ, καὶ ἰδού, ",
            "type": "text",
            "attrs": {
              "verseId": "MAT.28.9",
              "verseOrgIds": [
                "MAT.28.9"
              ]
            }
          },
          {
            "text": "Ἰησοῦς ",
            "type": "text",
            "attrs": {
              "verseId": "MAT.28.9",
              "verseOrgIds": [
                "MAT.28.9"
              ]
            }
          },
          {
            "text": "ἀπήντησεν αὐταῖς, λέγων, ",
            "type": "text",
            "attrs": {
              "verseId": "MAT.28.9",
              "verseOrgIds": [
                "MAT.28.9"
              ]
            }
          },
          {
            "name": "char",
            "type": "tag",
            "attrs": {
              "style": "wj"
            },
            "items": [
              {
                "text": "Χαίρετε.",
                "type": "text",
                "attrs": {
                  "verseId": "MAT.28.9",
                  "verseOrgIds": [
                    "MAT.28.9"
                  ]
                }
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "text": " Αἱ δὲ προσελθοῦσαι ἐκράτησαν αὐτοῦ τοὺς πόδας, καὶ προσεκύνησαν αὐτῷ. ",
            "type": "text",
            "attrs": {
              "verseId": "MAT.28.9",
              "verseOrgIds": [
                "MAT.28.9"
              ]
            }
          },
          {
            "text": "Τότε λέγει αὐταῖς ὁ Ἰησοῦς· ",
            "type": "text",
            "attrs": {
              "verseId": "MAT.28.10",
              "verseOrgIds": [
                "MAT.28.10"
              ]
            }
          },
          {
            "name": "char",
            "type": "tag",
            "attrs": {
              "style": "wj"
            },
            "items": [
              {
                "text": "Μὴ φοβεῖσθε· ὑπάγετε, ἀπαγγείλατε τοῖς ἀδελφοῖς μου ἵνα ἀπέλθωσιν εἰς τὴν Γαλιλαίαν,",
                "type": "text",
                "attrs": {
                  "verseId": "MAT.28.10",
                  "verseOrgIds": [
                    "MAT.28.10"
                  ]
                }
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "text": " ",
            "type": "text",
            "attrs": {
              "verseId": "MAT.28.10",
              "verseOrgIds": [
                "MAT.28.10"
              ]
            }
          },
          {
            "name": "char",
            "type": "tag",
            "attrs": {
              "style": "wj"
            },
            "items": [
              {
                "text": "καὶ ἐκεῖ με ὄψονται.",
                "type": "text",
                "attrs": {
                  "verseId": "MAT.28.10",
                  "verseOrgIds": [
                    "MAT.28.10"
                  ]
                }
              }
            ]
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "name": "para",
        "type": "tag",
        "attrs": {
          "style": "s"
        },
        "items": [
          {
            "text": "The Soldiers Bribed to Lie",
            "type": "text"
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "name": "para",
        "type": "tag",
        "attrs": {
          "style": "p"
        },
        "items": [
          {
            "text": "Πορευομένων δὲ αὐτῶν, ἰδού, τινὲς τῆς κουστωδίας ἐλθόντες εἰς τὴν πόλιν ἀπήγγειλαν τοῖς ἀρχιερεῦσιν ἅπαντα τὰ γενόμενα. ",
            "type": "text",
            "attrs": {
              "verseId": "MAT.28.11",
              "verseOrgIds": [
                "MAT.28.11"
              ]
            }
          },
          {
            "text": "Καὶ συναχθέντες μετὰ τῶν πρεσβυτέρων, συμβούλιόν τε λαβόντες, ἀργύρια ἱκανὰ ἔδωκαν τοῖς στρατιώταις, ",
            "type": "text",
            "attrs": {
              "verseId": "MAT.28.12",
              "verseOrgIds": [
                "MAT.28.12"
              ]
            }
          },
          {
            "text": "λέγοντες, Εἴπατε ὅτι Οἱ μαθηταὶ αὐτοῦ νυκτὸς ἐλθόντες ἔκλεψαν αὐτὸν ἡμῶν κοιμωμένων. ",
            "type": "text",
            "attrs": {
              "verseId": "MAT.28.13",
              "verseOrgIds": [
                "MAT.28.13"
              ]
            }
          },
          {
            "text": "Καὶ ἐὰν ἀκουσθῇ τοῦτο ἐπὶ τοῦ ἡγεμόνος, ἡμεῖς πείσομεν ",
            "type": "text",
            "attrs": {
              "verseId": "MAT.28.14",
              "verseOrgIds": [
                "MAT.28.14"
              ]
            }
          },
          {
            "text": "αὐτόν, καὶ ὑμᾶς ἀμερίμνους ποιήσομεν. ",
            "type": "text",
            "attrs": {
              "verseId": "MAT.28.14",
              "verseOrgIds": [
                "MAT.28.14"
              ]
            }
          },
          {
            "text": "Οἱ δὲ λαβόντες ",
            "type": "text",
            "attrs": {
              "verseId": "MAT.28.15",
              "verseOrgIds": [
                "MAT.28.15"
              ]
            }
          },
          {
            "text": "τὰ ἀργύρια ἐποίησαν ὡς ἐδιδάχθησαν. Καὶ διεφημίσθη ὁ λόγος οὗτος παρὰ Ἰουδαίοις μέχρι τῆς ",
            "type": "text",
            "attrs": {
              "verseId": "MAT.28.15",
              "verseOrgIds": [
                "MAT.28.15"
              ]
            }
          },
          {
            "text": "σήμερον.",
            "type": "text",
            "attrs": {
              "verseId": "MAT.28.15",
              "verseOrgIds": [
                "MAT.28.15"
              ]
            }
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "name": "para",
        "type": "tag",
        "attrs": {
          "style": "s"
        },
        "items": [
          {
            "text": "The Great Commission",
            "type": "text"
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "name": "para",
        "type": "tag",
        "attrs": {
          "style": "p"
        },
        "items": [
          {
            "text": "Οἱ δὲ ἕνδεκα μαθηταὶ ἐπορεύθησαν εἰς τὴν Γαλιλαίαν, εἰς τὸ ὄρος οὗ ἐτάξατο αὐτοῖς ὁ Ἰησοῦς. ",
            "type": "text",
            "attrs": {
              "verseId": "MAT.28.16",
              "verseOrgIds": [
                "MAT.28.16"
              ]
            }
          },
          {
            "text": "Καὶ ἰδόντες αὐτὸν προσεκύνησαν ",
            "type": "text",
            "attrs": {
              "verseId": "MAT.28.17",
              "verseOrgIds": [
                "MAT.28.17"
              ]
            }
          },
          {
            "text": "αὐτῷ· οἱ δὲ ἐδίστασαν. ",
            "type": "text",
            "attrs": {
              "verseId": "MAT.28.17",
              "verseOrgIds": [
                "MAT.28.17"
              ]
            }
          },
          {
            "text": "Καὶ προσελθὼν ὁ Ἰησοῦς ἐλάλησεν αὐτοῖς, λέγων, ",
            "type": "text",
            "attrs": {
              "verseId": "MAT.28.18",
              "verseOrgIds": [
                "MAT.28.18"
              ]
            }
          },
          {
            "name": "char",
            "type": "tag",
            "attrs": {
              "style": "wj"
            },
            "items": [
              {
                "text": "Ἐδόθη μοι πᾶσα ἐξουσία ἐν οὐρανῷ καὶ ἐπὶ",
                "type": "text",
                "attrs": {
                  "verseId": "MAT.28.18",
                  "verseOrgIds": [
                    "MAT.28.18"
                  ]
                }
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "text": " ",
            "type": "text",
            "attrs": {
              "verseId": "MAT.28.18",
              "verseOrgIds": [
                "MAT.28.18"
              ]
            }
          },
          {
            "name": "char",
            "type": "tag",
            "attrs": {
              "style": "wj"
            },
            "items": [
              {
                "text": "γῆς.",
                "type": "text",
                "attrs": {
                  "verseId": "MAT.28.18",
                  "verseOrgIds": [
                    "MAT.28.18"
                  ]
                }
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "text": " ",
            "type": "text",
            "attrs": {
              "verseId": "MAT.28.18",
              "verseOrgIds": [
                "MAT.28.18"
              ]
            }
          },
          {
            "name": "char",
            "type": "tag",
            "attrs": {
              "style": "wj"
            },
            "items": [
              {
                "text": "Πορευθέντες μαθητεύσατε πάντα τὰ ἔθνη, βαπτίζοντες αὐτοὺς εἰς τὸ ὄνομα τοῦ Πατρὸς καὶ τοῦ Υἱοῦ καὶ τοῦ Ἁγίου Πνεύματος·",
                "type": "text",
                "attrs": {
                  "verseId": "MAT.28.19",
                  "verseOrgIds": [
                    "MAT.28.19"
                  ]
                }
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "text": " ",
            "type": "text",
            "attrs": {
              "verseId": "MAT.28.19",
              "verseOrgIds": [
                "MAT.28.19"
              ]
            }
          },
          {
            "name": "char",
            "type": "tag",
            "attrs": {
              "style": "wj"
            },
            "items": [
              {
                "text": "διδάσκοντες αὐτοὺς τηρεῖν πάντα ὅσα ἐνετειλάμην ὑμῖν· καὶ ἰδού, ἐγὼ μεθ᾽ ὑμῶν εἰμι πάσας τὰς ἡμέρας ἕως τῆς συντελείας τοῦ αἰῶνος.",
                "type": "text",
                "attrs": {
                  "verseId": "MAT.28.20",
                  "verseOrgIds": [
                    "MAT.28.20"
                  ]
                }
              }
            ]
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "name": "para",
        "type": "tag",
        "attrs": {
          "style": "pc",
          "vid": "MAT 28:20"
        },
        "items": [
          {
            "text": "Ἀμήν.",
            "type": "text",
            "attrs": {
              "verseId": "MAT.28.20",
              "verseOrgIds": [
                "MAT.28.20"
              ]
            }
          }
        ]
      }
    ],
    "verseCount": 20,
    "copyright": "Public Domain",
    "parallels": [
      {
        "id": "MAT.28.1-MAT.28.20",
        "orgId": "MAT.28.1-MAT.28.20",
        "bibleId": "de4e12af7f28f599-01",
        "bookId": "MAT",
        "chapterIds": [
          "MAT.28"
        ],
        "reference": "Matthew 28:1-20",
        "content": [
          {
            "name": "para",
            "type": "tag",
            "attrs": {
              "style": "p"
            },
            "items": [
              {
                "text": "In the end of the sabbath, as it began to dawn toward the first ",
                "type": "text",
                "attrs": {
                  "verseId": "MAT.28.1",
                  "verseOrgIds": [
                    "MAT.28.1"
                  ]
                }
              },
              {
                "name": "char",
                "type": "tag",
                "attrs": {
                  "style": "add"
                },
                "items": [
                  {
                    "text": "day",
                    "type": "text",
                    "attrs": {
                      "verseId": "MAT.28.1",
                      "verseOrgIds": [
                        "MAT.28.1"
                      ]
                    }
                  }
                ]
              },
              {
                "text": " of the week, came Mary Magdalene and the other Mary to see the sepulchre. ",
                "type": "text",
                "attrs": {
                  "verseId": "MAT.28.1",
                  "verseOrgIds": [
                    "MAT.28.1"
                  ]
                }
              },
              {
                "text": "And, behold, there was a great earthquake: for the angel of the Lord descended from heaven, and came and rolled back the stone from the door, and sat upon it. ",
                "type": "text",
                "attrs": {
                  "verseId": "MAT.28.2",
                  "verseOrgIds": [
                    "MAT.28.2"
                  ]
                }
              },
              {
                "text": "His countenance was like lightning, and his raiment white as snow: ",
                "type": "text",
                "attrs": {
                  "verseId": "MAT.28.3",
                  "verseOrgIds": [
                    "MAT.28.3"
                  ]
                }
              },
              {
                "text": "And for fear of him the keepers did shake, and became as dead ",
                "type": "text",
                "attrs": {
                  "verseId": "MAT.28.4",
                  "verseOrgIds": [
                    "MAT.28.4"
                  ]
                }
              },
              {
                "name": "char",
                "type": "tag",
                "attrs": {
                  "style": "add"
                },
                "items": [
                  {
                    "text": "men",
                    "type": "text",
                    "attrs": {
                      "verseId": "MAT.28.4",
                      "verseOrgIds": [
                        "MAT.28.4"
                      ]
                    }
                  }
                ]
              },
              {
                "text": ". ",
                "type": "text",
                "attrs": {
                  "verseId": "MAT.28.4",
                  "verseOrgIds": [
                    "MAT.28.4"
                  ]
                }
              },
              {
                "text": "And the angel answered and said unto the women, Fear not ye: for I know that ye seek Jesus, which was crucified. ",
                "type": "text",
                "attrs": {
                  "verseId": "MAT.28.5",
                  "verseOrgIds": [
                    "MAT.28.5"
                  ]
                }
              },
              {
                "text": "He is not here: for he is risen, as he said. Come, see the place where the Lord lay. ",
                "type": "text",
                "attrs": {
                  "verseId": "MAT.28.6",
                  "verseOrgIds": [
                    "MAT.28.6"
                  ]
                }
              },
              {
                "text": "And go quickly, and tell his disciples that he is risen from the dead; and, behold, he goeth before you into Galilee; there shall ye see him: lo, I have told you. ",
                "type": "text",
                "attrs": {
                  "verseId": "MAT.28.7",
                  "verseOrgIds": [
                    "MAT.28.7"
                  ]
                }
              },
              {
                "text": "And they departed quickly from the sepulchre with fear and great joy; and did run to bring his disciples word.",
                "type": "text",
                "attrs": {
                  "verseId": "MAT.28.8",
                  "verseOrgIds": [
                    "MAT.28.8"
                  ]
                }
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "name": "para",
            "type": "tag",
            "attrs": {
              "style": "p"
            },
            "items": [
              {
                "text": "¶ And as they went to tell his disciples, behold, Jesus met them, saying, ",
                "type": "text",
                "attrs": {
                  "verseId": "MAT.28.9",
                  "verseOrgIds": [
                    "MAT.28.9"
                  ]
                }
              },
              {
                "name": "char",
                "type": "tag",
                "attrs": {
                  "style": "wj"
                },
                "items": [
                  {
                    "text": "All hail.",
                    "type": "text",
                    "attrs": {
                      "verseId": "MAT.28.9",
                      "verseOrgIds": [
                        "MAT.28.9"
                      ]
                    }
                  }
                ]
              },
              {
                "text": " And they came and held him by the feet, and worshipped him. ",
                "type": "text",
                "attrs": {
                  "verseId": "MAT.28.9",
                  "verseOrgIds": [
                    "MAT.28.9"
                  ]
                }
              },
              {
                "text": "Then said Jesus unto them, ",
                "type": "text",
                "attrs": {
                  "verseId": "MAT.28.10",
                  "verseOrgIds": [
                    "MAT.28.10"
                  ]
                }
              },
              {
                "name": "char",
                "type": "tag",
                "attrs": {
                  "style": "wj"
                },
                "items": [
                  {
                    "text": "Be not afraid: go tell my brethren that they go into Galilee, and there shall they see me.",
                    "type": "text",
                    "attrs": {
                      "verseId": "MAT.28.10",
                      "verseOrgIds": [
                        "MAT.28.10"
                      ]
                    }
                  }
                ]
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "name": "para",
            "type": "tag",
            "attrs": {
              "style": "p"
            },
            "items": [
              {
                "text": "¶ Now when they were going, behold, some of the watch came into the city, and shewed unto the chief priests all the things that were done. ",
                "type": "text",
                "attrs": {
                  "verseId": "MAT.28.11",
                  "verseOrgIds": [
                    "MAT.28.11"
                  ]
                }
              },
              {
                "text": "And when they were assembled with the elders, and had taken counsel, they gave large money unto the soldiers, ",
                "type": "text",
                "attrs": {
                  "verseId": "MAT.28.12",
                  "verseOrgIds": [
                    "MAT.28.12"
                  ]
                }
              },
              {
                "text": "Saying, Say ye, His disciples came by night, and stole him ",
                "type": "text",
                "attrs": {
                  "verseId": "MAT.28.13",
                  "verseOrgIds": [
                    "MAT.28.13"
                  ]
                }
              },
              {
                "name": "char",
                "type": "tag",
                "attrs": {
                  "style": "add"
                },
                "items": [
                  {
                    "text": "away",
                    "type": "text",
                    "attrs": {
                      "verseId": "MAT.28.13",
                      "verseOrgIds": [
                        "MAT.28.13"
                      ]
                    }
                  }
                ]
              },
              {
                "text": " while we slept. ",
                "type": "text",
                "attrs": {
                  "verseId": "MAT.28.13",
                  "verseOrgIds": [
                    "MAT.28.13"
                  ]
                }
              },
              {
                "text": "And if this come to the governor’s ears, we will persuade him, and secure you. ",
                "type": "text",
                "attrs": {
                  "verseId": "MAT.28.14",
                  "verseOrgIds": [
                    "MAT.28.14"
                  ]
                }
              },
              {
                "text": "So they took the money, and did as they were taught: and this saying is commonly reported among the Jews until this day.",
                "type": "text",
                "attrs": {
                  "verseId": "MAT.28.15",
                  "verseOrgIds": [
                    "MAT.28.15"
                  ]
                }
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "name": "para",
            "type": "tag",
            "attrs": {
              "style": "p"
            },
            "items": [
              {
                "text": "¶ Then the eleven disciples went away into Galilee, into a mountain where Jesus had appointed them. ",
                "type": "text",
                "attrs": {
                  "verseId": "MAT.28.16",
                  "verseOrgIds": [
                    "MAT.28.16"
                  ]
                }
              },
              {
                "text": "And when they saw him, they worshipped him: but some doubted. ",
                "type": "text",
                "attrs": {
                  "verseId": "MAT.28.17",
                  "verseOrgIds": [
                    "MAT.28.17"
                  ]
                }
              },
              {
                "text": "And Jesus came and spake unto them, saying, ",
                "type": "text",
                "attrs": {
                  "verseId": "MAT.28.18",
                  "verseOrgIds": [
                    "MAT.28.18"
                  ]
                }
              },
              {
                "name": "char",
                "type": "tag",
                "attrs": {
                  "style": "wj"
                },
                "items": [
                  {
                    "text": "All power is given unto me in heaven and in earth.",
                    "type": "text",
                    "attrs": {
                      "verseId": "MAT.28.18",
                      "verseOrgIds": [
                        "MAT.28.18"
                      ]
                    }
                  }
                ]
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "name": "para",
            "type": "tag",
            "attrs": {
              "style": "p"
            },
            "items": [
              {
                "name": "char",
                "type": "tag",
                "attrs": {
                  "style": "wj"
                },
                "items": [
                  {
                    "text": "¶ Go ye therefore, and teach all nations, baptizing them in the name of the Father, and of the Son, and of the Holy Ghost:",
                    "type": "text",
                    "attrs": {
                      "verseId": "MAT.28.19",
                      "verseOrgIds": [
                        "MAT.28.19"
                      ]
                    }
                  }
                ]
              },
              {
                "text": " ",
                "type": "text",
                "attrs": {
                  "verseId": "MAT.28.19",
                  "verseOrgIds": [
                    "MAT.28.19"
                  ]
                }
              },
              {
                "name": "char",
                "type": "tag",
                "attrs": {
                  "style": "wj"
                },
                "items": [
                  {
                    "text": "Teaching them to observe all things whatsoever I have commanded you: and, lo, I am with you alway, ",
                    "type": "text",
                    "attrs": {
                      "verseId": "MAT.28.20",
                      "verseOrgIds": [
                        "MAT.28.20"
                      ]
                    }
                  },
                  {
                    "name": "char",
                    "type": "tag",
                    "attrs": {
                      "style": "add"
                    },
                    "items": [
                      {
                        "text": "even",
                        "type": "text",
                        "attrs": {
                          "verseId": "MAT.28.20",
                          "verseOrgIds": [
                            "MAT.28.20"
                          ]
                        }
                      }
                    ]
                  },
                  {
                    "text": " unto the end of the world.",
                    "type": "text",
                    "attrs": {
                      "verseId": "MAT.28.20",
                      "verseOrgIds": [
                        "MAT.28.20"
                      ]
                    }
                  }
                ]
              },
              {
                "text": " Amen.",
                "type": "text",
                "attrs": {
                  "verseId": "MAT.28.20",
                  "verseOrgIds": [
                    "MAT.28.20"
                  ]
                }
              }
            ]
          }
        ],
        "verseCount": 20,
        "copyright": "PUBLIC DOMAIN except in the United Kingdom, where a Crown Copyright applies to printing the KJV. See http://www.cambridge.org/about-us/who-we-are/queens-printers-patent"
      },
      {
        "id": "MAT.28.1-MAT.28.20",
        "orgId": "MAT.28.1-MAT.28.20",
        "bibleId": "01b29f4b342acc35-01",
        "bookId": "MAT",
        "chapterIds": [
          "MAT.28"
        ],
        "reference": "Matthew 28:1-20",
        "content": [
          {
            "name": "para",
            "type": "tag",
            "attrs": {
              "style": "p"
            },
            "items": [
              {
                "text": "Now after [the] Sabbaths, it being dawn, toward the first [day] of the weeks, Mary the Magdalene came, and the other Mary, to see the grave, ",
                "type": "text",
                "attrs": {
                  "verseId": "MAT.28.1",
                  "verseOrgIds": [
                    "MAT.28.1"
                  ]
                }
              },
              {
                "text": "and behold, there came a great earthquake, for a messenger of the LORD, having come down out of Heaven, having come, rolled away the stone from the door, and was sitting on it, ",
                "type": "text",
                "attrs": {
                  "verseId": "MAT.28.2",
                  "verseOrgIds": [
                    "MAT.28.2"
                  ]
                }
              },
              {
                "text": "and his countenance was as lightning, and his clothing white as snow, ",
                "type": "text",
                "attrs": {
                  "verseId": "MAT.28.3",
                  "verseOrgIds": [
                    "MAT.28.3"
                  ]
                }
              },
              {
                "text": "and from the fear of him the keepers shook, and they became as dead men. ",
                "type": "text",
                "attrs": {
                  "verseId": "MAT.28.4",
                  "verseOrgIds": [
                    "MAT.28.4"
                  ]
                }
              },
              {
                "text": "And the messenger answering said to the women, “Do not fear, for I have known that you seek Jesus who has been crucified; ",
                "type": "text",
                "attrs": {
                  "verseId": "MAT.28.5",
                  "verseOrgIds": [
                    "MAT.28.5"
                  ]
                }
              },
              {
                "text": "He is not here, for He rose, as He said; come, see the place where the LORD was lying; ",
                "type": "text",
                "attrs": {
                  "verseId": "MAT.28.6",
                  "verseOrgIds": [
                    "MAT.28.6"
                  ]
                }
              },
              {
                "text": "and having gone quickly, say to His disciples that He rose from the dead; and behold, He goes before you to Galilee, there you will see Him; behold, I have told you.” ",
                "type": "text",
                "attrs": {
                  "verseId": "MAT.28.7",
                  "verseOrgIds": [
                    "MAT.28.7"
                  ]
                }
              },
              {
                "text": "And having gone forth quickly from the tomb, with fear and great joy, they ran to tell His disciples; ",
                "type": "text",
                "attrs": {
                  "verseId": "MAT.28.8",
                  "verseOrgIds": [
                    "MAT.28.8"
                  ]
                }
              },
              {
                "text": "and as they were going to tell His disciples, then behold, Jesus met them, saying, “Greetings!” And having come near, they laid hold of His feet, and worshiped Him. ",
                "type": "text",
                "attrs": {
                  "verseId": "MAT.28.9",
                  "verseOrgIds": [
                    "MAT.28.9"
                  ]
                }
              },
              {
                "text": "Then Jesus says to them, “Do not fear, go away, tell My brothers that they may go away to Galilee, and there they will see Me.” ",
                "type": "text",
                "attrs": {
                  "verseId": "MAT.28.10",
                  "verseOrgIds": [
                    "MAT.28.10"
                  ]
                }
              },
              {
                "text": "And while they are going on, behold, certain of the guard having come into the city, reported to the chief priests all the things that happened, ",
                "type": "text",
                "attrs": {
                  "verseId": "MAT.28.11",
                  "verseOrgIds": [
                    "MAT.28.11"
                  ]
                }
              },
              {
                "text": "and having been gathered together with the elders, having also taken counsel, they gave much money to the soldiers, ",
                "type": "text",
                "attrs": {
                  "verseId": "MAT.28.12",
                  "verseOrgIds": [
                    "MAT.28.12"
                  ]
                }
              },
              {
                "text": "saying, “Say that His disciples having come by night, stole Him—we being asleep; ",
                "type": "text",
                "attrs": {
                  "verseId": "MAT.28.13",
                  "verseOrgIds": [
                    "MAT.28.13"
                  ]
                }
              },
              {
                "text": "and if this is heard by the governor, we will persuade him, and you keep free from anxiety.” ",
                "type": "text",
                "attrs": {
                  "verseId": "MAT.28.14",
                  "verseOrgIds": [
                    "MAT.28.14"
                  ]
                }
              },
              {
                "text": "And they, having received the money, did as they were taught, and this account was spread abroad among Jews until this day. ",
                "type": "text",
                "attrs": {
                  "verseId": "MAT.28.15",
                  "verseOrgIds": [
                    "MAT.28.15"
                  ]
                }
              },
              {
                "text": "And the eleven disciples went to Galilee, to the mountain where Jesus appointed them, ",
                "type": "text",
                "attrs": {
                  "verseId": "MAT.28.16",
                  "verseOrgIds": [
                    "MAT.28.16"
                  ]
                }
              },
              {
                "text": "and having seen Him, they worshiped Him, but some wavered. ",
                "type": "text",
                "attrs": {
                  "verseId": "MAT.28.17",
                  "verseOrgIds": [
                    "MAT.28.17"
                  ]
                }
              },
              {
                "text": "And having come near, Jesus spoke to them, saying, “All authority in Heaven and on earth was given to Me; ",
                "type": "text",
                "attrs": {
                  "verseId": "MAT.28.18",
                  "verseOrgIds": [
                    "MAT.28.18"
                  ]
                }
              },
              {
                "text": "having gone, then, disciple all the nations, immersing them into the Name of the Father, and of the Son, and of the Holy Spirit, ",
                "type": "text",
                "attrs": {
                  "verseId": "MAT.28.19",
                  "verseOrgIds": [
                    "MAT.28.19"
                  ]
                }
              },
              {
                "text": "teaching them to observe all, whatever I commanded you, and behold, I am with you all the days—until the full end of the age.”",
                "type": "text",
                "attrs": {
                  "verseId": "MAT.28.20",
                  "verseOrgIds": [
                    "MAT.28.20"
                  ]
                }
              }
            ]
          }
        ],
        "verseCount": 20,
